# Keep the Docker build context small and deterministic.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github
*.log

# Local env & upload storage — never bake into an image
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
apps/api/uploads

# Large local-only artifacts
blueprint.html
frame-prototype.html
*.md
!README.md
